    "verbatimEvidence": "Many recruiters say the old disgrace is fading for top performers. The financial crisis has made it more acceptable to be between jobs or to leave a bad one. \"The traditional rule was it's safer to stay where you are, but that's been fundamentally inverted,\" says one headhunter. \"The people who've been hurt the worst are those who've stayed too long.\"",
